<title>INDIA: India's IOC.BO 1st half 96/97 results.</title>
<headline>India's IOC.BO 1st half 96/97 results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-September</p>
<p>		(in billion rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 8.44 vs   7.43</p>
<p>    Sales		    279.67 vs 208.26</p>
<p>    Other income	     0.59 vs   0.90</p>
<p>    Expenditure	    264.54 vs 196.31</p>
<p>    Net interest	     1.26 vs   0.49</p>
<p>    Gross profit	    14.47 vs  12.37</p>
<p>    Depreciation	     3.50 vs   2.16</p>
<p>NOTE: Indian Oil Corp Ltd (IOC) released the results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
